  "notes": "Café POS back-office dashboard ('Flo'). Signature: the four top KPI tiles are each pastel-tinted (mint, sky, cream, lavender) with matching thin border and a rounded-square colored icon chip; values in huge bold Geist. Everything else is white panels with 18px radius, 1px light border and faint shadow; each panel header has a pastel icon chip + title + blue 'View all →' link. Status pills are colored text (amber Pending, blue Preparing, green Ready, gray Completed). Single brand blue #3248ff for primary button, active nav, links and payment bars; black pill for the active segment. A thin app status bar at the bottom shows printer connection, 'Shift opened' pill and Diagnostics & Logs — POS-operational chrome. 'Close day' is a domain-specific end-of-day primary action."
